nActually, in NetHack, the starting inventory for Healers varies by version, but typically they start with a wand of healing. The sleep wand might not be in their starting inventory.\n\nLet me check the item inventory code to see what Healers start with.","time":{"start":1790518451038,"end":1790518457480}}}
